	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d07r0101_workman3_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ゆきの　うえを　あるくと
あしが　いつもより　しずみこむ▼
その　かんしょくが
ちからづよくて　ぐっとくる！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-21T03:11:49" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:13" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>雪上を　歩くと
足が　いつもより　沈みこむ▼
その感触が
力強くて　ぐっとくる！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-21T03:12:21" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:13" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・GRIDX=22、GRIDZ=21付近を移動
　雪のとき、移動範囲を教えるため
※swanでメッセージ修正</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-21T02:41:42" />
		</CommentCell>
